{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/extras/gametextlogoeng.png?t=1746737197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gensokyo has suddenly been swept up in a foodie trend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yuuka Kazami joins in and tries all kinds of dishes she never had the chance to taste before in Gensokyo\u2026 but in doing so, she ends up spending all the human money she had.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then, out of the blue, Yukari Yakumo pays her a visit and suggests she run a flower shop...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But all of a sudden, Yukari Yakumo visits her and suggests her to run a flower shop...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Danmaku (Bullet-Hell) + Tycoon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yuuka must earn money by using her powers to grow flowers in the backyard of her flower shop, selling them to customers, and completing quests\u2014while also fending off mischievous, bullet-shooting fairies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/extras/9en.png?t=1746737197\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a danmaku game, but you won't be frustrated with limited HP or losing from a couple of bullet hits. You can take some damage without stressing out, even when the screen is full of bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be careful not to collapse the flower shop with too many Bombs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/extras/4en.png?t=1746737197\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll encounter unexpected visitors while running your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Protect it from their wild challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/extras/7en.png?t=1746737197\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you continue to do business, the number of customers will increase and the fairies that appear will become stronger. Use the money you earn every day to train Yuuka and strengthen your flower shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/extras/ramen.jpg?t=1746737197\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yuuka and the staff members try season-limited dishes on specific dates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help them taste everything they can!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3710340?t=1746737197","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/c71f90ff1359ce32b8670e69d1cae88fa75e6ce4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746737197","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/1190a2bc9eab91156544d8b89e91344460f8782b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746737197","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/1190a2bc9eab91156544d8b89e91344460f8782b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746737197","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/extras/gametextlogoeng.png?t=1746737197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gensokyo has suddenly been swept up in a foodie trend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yuuka Kazami joins in and tries all kinds of dishes she never had the chance to taste before in Gensokyo\u2026 but in doing so, she ends up spending all the human money she had.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then, out of the blue, Yukari Yakumo pays her a visit and suggests she run a flower shop...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But all of a sudden, Yukari Yakumo visits her and suggests her to run a flower shop...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Danmaku (Bullet-Hell) + Tycoon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yuuka must earn money by using her powers to grow flowers in the backyard of her flower shop, selling them to customers, and completing quests\u2014while also fending off mischievous, bullet-shooting fairies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/extras/9en.png?t=1746737197\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a danmaku game, but you won't be frustrated with limited HP or losing from a couple of bullet hits. You can take some damage without stressing out, even when the screen is full of bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be careful not to collapse the flower shop with too many Bombs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/extras/4en.png?t=1746737197\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll encounter unexpected visitors while running your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Protect it from their wild challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/extras/7en.png?t=1746737197\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you continue to do business, the number of customers will increase and the fairies that appear will become stronger. Use the money you earn every day to train Yuuka and strengthen your flower shop!